--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files in this package derived from the upstream sources, and modified
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/*.dart
    Independent Dart implementations of the Playwright public API surface
    (Page, Locator, Frame, FrameLocator, BrowserContext, Browser, Request,
    Response, Route, ConsoleMessage, Dialog). The names, the option sets and
    the observable behaviour follow packages/playwright-core/src/client/
    and docs/src/api/ of the upstream project; the code is written from
    scratch in Dart. Individual alignments are cited in the comments of the
    file they appear in.

lib/src/recorder/*.dart
    Port of the recorder: packages/playwright-core/src/server/recorder.ts,
    recorder/recorderSignalProcessor.ts, recorder/recorderUtils.ts,
    recorder/recorderRunner.ts, recorder/throttledFile.ts, the
    `ProgrammaticRecorderApp` half of recorder/recorderApp.ts, and the
    `codegen` command of src/cli/program.ts. Modified: no inspector (this
    port has no debugger), no `api` recorder mode, no auto-expect
    precondition, and the user interface of packages/recorder/src is
    replaced by terminal output.
